ind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.3.0 — 70 cards across six categories and 35 upgrade paths","summary":"- Adjusted archers to release arrows when their bow-drawing animation reaches the release, including after attack-speed upgrades.- Battering rams now hit as the ram reaches forward, and mangonels swing their arm before releasing a stone. Ballista bolts stay loaded until firing.- Enlarged main menu icon shadows with a softer dark green tint, and made menu labels always visible.- Fixed main menu labels remaining over other pages.- Card descriptions now show the complete effect text in all supporte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T15:38:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042150","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:34:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5128610-1847286114031176","game_id":"steam-5128610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.2.0 — New Main Menu & Improvements","summary":"0.2.0 10-21- Added \"News & Updates\" to view Steam announcements with images and local patch notes in-game.- Revamped the main menu with an interactive 3D riverside map.- Improved health bar visuals.- Fixed various bugs.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:36:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031176","verified_at":"2026-10-22T07:52:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5128610-1846651706695273","game_id":"steam-5128610","kind":"announcement","title":"Warharvest RTS Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The Warharvest RTS demo is now available to play for free on Steam! Gather resources, build your base, expand, and train troops. Then take your army onto a hex battlefield, where the ground you hold and the cards you choose shape your strategy throughout the match. A hex battlefield, fought in real time Hexes make positioning matter, but the fighting stays real-time. Hold high ground, find routes through forests and river crossings, and look for opportunities to surround the enemy. Humans, Elves","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:31:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5128610-1846651706689777","game_id":"steam-5128610","kind":"announcement","title":"Fog of War on Procedural Hex Maps","summary":"Fog of war is one of those systems that looks simple until you try to make it feel good. We rebuilt ours from scratch for the hex maps, and this is where it landed.Unexplored ground now sits under a dense violet cloud. It is heavy enough to hide the terrain underneath, so pushing into it is a real decision. Once a squad has scouted an area, the fog thins into a pale haze: you keep the terrain you discovered, but you do not keep the enemy that walked through it.The cloud itself is a volume rather","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:19:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5128610-1842846814444286","game_id":"steam-5128610","kind":"announcement","title":"Warharvest RTS NOW on Steam!","summary":"Hey everyone!It’s great to finally have Warharvest RTS on Steam.The Demo isn’t ready just yet—we’re still working on it but sooon. We’ll share gameplay clips, screenshots, and occasional progress updates here along the way.If the game looks interesting to you, feel free to wishlist or follow it. You’re also very welcome to join our Discord and chat with us:Join the Warharvest RTS DiscordThanks for stopping by this early. It genuinely means a lot!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T18:16:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444286","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5128610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5128610":"2026-10-26T08:43:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5128610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:42Z"},"5240980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:43Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5128610","app_id":5128610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"aec44bda538eb1670ef0b825ec0e0b6219b3dca3740fc1e693f9ea6fd7819d8a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"육각형 전장의 RTS로, 기존 RTS의 기반과 경기 중 카드 선택을 결합했습니다: 자원을 모으고, 건설하고, 확장하고, 병력을 훈련하는 가운데 진정한 성장은 전장에서 일어납니다 — 아군이 이뤄내는 하나하나의 전과가 다음 카드 선택의 충전이 되고, 플레이 방식을 바꾸며 전세를 뒤집습니다. 3D 픽셀 아트로 표현된 이 게임은 방식이 크게 다른 네 진영을 제공하며, AI 솔로전과 최대 8인 PvP를 지원합니다.","publishers":[{"name":"xCaveman Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"xCaveman Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":null},"field_present":{"basic_info":true